{
  "said": "It's just me signing off on the job, and I keep a photo of the gauge and the sidewall for my own peace of mind. When you're riding in city traffic, a tyre letting go at speed puts you right under a car, so I make sure it's right.",
  "used_facts": [
    "who signs it off: just me",
    "evidence I keep: photo of the gauge reading and a photo of the sidewall so you can see the number I was aiming for",
    "What is at stake if a job is done badly: it gets ridden in city traffic and on gravel; a brake or a tyre letting go at speed puts the rider under a car."
  ],
  "knew_it": true
}
